{{CSS|Gadget-Tabs}}
Template for creating tabs for navigation.

==Syntax==
{{T|CustomTabs
|p1 =rootpage  = 
|p2 =namespace = 
|p3 =subpages  = 
|p4 =tab1      = 
|p5 =tab2      = 
|p6 =tab3      = 
|p7 =tab4      = 
|p8 =tab5      = 
|p9 =tab6      = 
|p10=tab7      = 
|p11=tab8      = 
|p12=tab9      = 
|block=1}}
*{{F|rootpage}} &mdash; title of root page if not using current page's root.
*{{F|namespace}} &mdash; name of namespace if not using current page's namespace. Use empty parameter for main namespace.
*{{F|subpages}} &mdash; tabs are subpages of the first if set to 1, otherwise are notm. Default {{F|1}}.
*{{F|tab1}} &mdash; title of first tab.
*{{F|tab2}}, {{F|tab3}}, {{F|tab4}}, {{F|tab5}}, {{F|tab6}}, {{F|tab7}}, {{F|tab8}}, {{F|tab9}} &mdash; title of subpage tabs.

==Examples==
{{T|CustomTabs|block=1|_Yn_=1
|p1=tab1 = Overview
|p2=tab2 = Story
|p3=tab3 = Voicelines
|p4=tab4 = Media
}}
{{T|CustomTabs|block=1|_Yn_=1
|p1=rootpage  = Unreconciled Stars
|p2=namespace = 
|p3=class     = custom-tabs-secondary
|p4=tab1      = Overview
|p5=tab2      = Story
|p6=tab3      = Unknown Star
|p7=tab4      = Star of Deceitful Dreams
|p8=tab5      = Star of Destiny
|p9=tab6      = Gallery
}}
{{T|CustomTabs|block=1|_Yn_=1
|p1=namespace = 
|p2=subpages  = 0
|p3=class     = custom-tabs-tertiary
|p4=tab1      = Traveler
|p5=tab1name  = First Tab
|p6=tab2      = Amber
|p7=tab2name  = Second Tab
|p8=tab3      = Kaeya
|p9=tab3name  = Third Tab
|p10=tab4      = Lisa
|p11=tab4name  = Forth Tab
}}

